;    2: TDecorate(count=284, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=198, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=31, unk2=13464750, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=64, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=7, unk2=16755370, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=340, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ひ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16777215, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=24, unk2=255, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   11: TDecorate(count=3, unk2=16757864, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=じんちょうげ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   12: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   13: TDecorate(count=5, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=3228, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=2917, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\すずめ.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\幸太郎の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>I had gone to bed with all sorts of things on my mind, but I seemed to have slept well enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Usually <STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> sleeps beside me, but this time she seemed to have spent the night in the Motoki-cho group's room.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Good morning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, good morning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only one in the living room was <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE> seemed to be in the kitchen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What about the Motoki-cho group? Still asleep?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... When I woke up this morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the others were gone too. I imagine they're out for a walk somewhere around here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A walk... But going for a walk at this time of year..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... I think they'll be fine as long as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is with them."</STYLE><PG>
I get the feeling <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE> is oddly optimistic.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, she said she had originally meant to show everyone the succession rite too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thinking about it now, that is quite an optimistic idea as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> and the rest will not act directly, I expect, so I do think it will be all right.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But why would <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> both do something so dangerous...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Now then, let's eat early and be on our way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> and I will go and bring out the ritual implements. I have to show </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> around the underground storeroom too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... The underground storeroom..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Is something wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... It's nothing."</STYLE><PG>
To <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE>, the underground storeroom must be what you might call a place of trauma.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ten years ago, in the grip of that murderous intent, <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE> was confined in the underground storeroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That nightmare must still be vivid to her even now.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well then, I'll go for a walk too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... The usual place?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... Then let's go together part of the way."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1朝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The three of us, <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE> and I, were walking along the path that leads to the underground storeroom and the graveyard clearing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A pleasant air, spring through and through.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this season that ought to be so refreshing, curse-killings happen every year.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why the curse-killings happen, only I know.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> promised me. Not to lay a hand on anyone of the Niimura main house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then is it all right for me to leave the other residents to die?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have gone through that struggle thousands of times by now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And yet even now, here I am...<PG>
At this point, there is no <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ひ">turning back</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am sorry to the people who have been sacrificed so far, and to their families.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I did not do it with my own hands, but I knew, and I kept silent the whole time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I made this public―<PG>
<STYLE ID="9">Then</STYLE>, just as <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> wishes, there would be no more humans here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But at the same time, I would no longer be able to see <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> would finish her role as a walking corpse and be absorbed into <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>, and I could no longer meet her even in the form of a divine messenger.<PG>
What am I doing?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This year, all the divine messengers will be assembled.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So either way, I will no longer be able to see <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or, because I have cooperated with <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> all this time, might that time be put off a little longer?<PG>
If the people are gone from here, there will be no more threat to <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one will carry off its fruiting bodies anymore, and it can breed freely in this land.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, all <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> wants is to spend its days quietly here.<PG>
But lately, I have been thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I want to be with <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> forever, I need only become a living first generation myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I would be with <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> always.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But what would become of my sense of self?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Would my human sense of self not be buried, and I be reduced to a mere will-less organ of <STYLE ID="10">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it came to that, there would be no point at all.<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, we're here. Will you pick some </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="じんちょうげ">daphne</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> before you go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, then I'll go straight on to the stream."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I will go straight on to get ready for the service once we have the ritual implements."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Got it. See you at the service, then."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE> headed off toward <STYLE ID="1">Kana's</STYLE> secret base―the underground storeroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Meanwhile I will pick the daphne <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> loved, and once the two of them are gone, I will go underground too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\和ぴあの２.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田森1朝グレー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ学生バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, next month we'll be husband and wife."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haha, hearing that we'll be husband and wife... Somehow it doesn't feel very real."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"My! And </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> were the one who said we should get married!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hahaha, sorry, sorry!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> and I had graduated from high school, and we were going to marry as soon as May came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
April would have been fine too, but the people of Arata die in this season.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mom</STYLE> had said it was hardly fitting for a mourning and a celebration to fall in the same season, and so it was settled on May.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"How many kids do </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> want?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"K-kids, huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"It's that kind of settlement, after all, so it's better to be blessed with children, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're right. Haha, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you're</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> getting ahead of yourself."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Ah, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, daphne!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> pointed, low, pale pink flowers were clustered together.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\沈丁花グレー.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The late-blooming daphne here overlaps with cherry blossom season, doesn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I like daphne."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh, that's the first I've heard of it."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yeah, I've only started feeling that way lately. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Because... it's the complete opposite of cherry blossoms."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> said she hated her own looks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because she had such beauty, she was easily drawn into trouble in middle and high school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even before that, <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>, who did not like to stand out, had worried about how others saw her since elementary school.<PG>
The cherry blossom, the flower that shared her name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Daphne was the very opposite of that cherry blossom, <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE> would sometimes say.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Daphne grows low, and next to cherry blossoms it isn't showy at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Just like hydrangea, it suits rain more than sunshine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you know what daphne means in the language of flowers... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Immortality, imperishability, eternity, they say."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Immortality, imperishability, eternity..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, just hypothetically, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　If I die, offer me these flowers."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Sorry for bringing up something strange..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">All right, I'll remember that."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\沈丁花.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Over these 10 years, how many daphne flowers have I picked?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I keep offering these flowers to <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>, who appears before me even in death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I can do for <STYLE ID="7">Sakura</STYLE>... is that.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
As always, I picked daphne and headed for the underground storeroom.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now and then I also leave some at the stream where <STYLE ID="7">Sakura's</STYLE> body was found.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that is camouflage.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With these in hand, I go to that place.<PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
―!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sensed someone nearby and hid myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A good while had passed since I parted ways with <STYLE ID="3">Chigaya</STYLE>. Were they still doing something here?<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Was that <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana</STYLE> was there too, and <STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="13">Goto-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. So that was what the early-morning walk was about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They must have thought there was something in that underground space.<PG>
But they could not have reached that place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To get there, you need the key I have on me now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That iron-barred door was apparently put in by the Grand Witch two generations back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Officially, the reason given is that there was a cave-in.<PG>
But in fact, that is not the case.
